</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Psionicist Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Updated March 2006.


Vorek gives you the information you requested.
Name: The Psionicists
Command: psionicist
Creators: Grimsh, Blitzer and Drakken
Maximum level: 35


Description:
Psionicists are the masters of the mind. They also master certain common
magics, but should not be associated with real magic-users; mages think of
them as revolting abusers of the weave of magic (the psionicists are commonly
feared for their unknown combinations of magic and powers of the mind). 


Joining requirements:
 Background must be magical (wrong or incomplete)
Abilities gained when joining:
 Receive the tattoo of the blue star
 May train skill Cast generic to 19%
 May train skill Cast psionic to 19%
 May train skill Cast control to 19%
 May train skill Mana control to 19%
 May train skill Attack to 19%
 May train skill Consider to 19%
 May train skill Short blades to 19%
 May study spell Mind blast to 20%
 May study spell Mirror image to 20%
 May study spell Darkness to 20%
 May study spell Light to 20%


Abilities and requirements at each level:
 Level 2:
  Requirements:
   Has trained skill Cast generic to at least 15% (passed)
   Has trained skill Cast psionic to at least 15% (at 0%)
   Has trained skill Mana control to at least 15% (passed)
   Has studied spell Mind blast to at least 15% (at 0%)
   Has studied spell Darkness to at least 10% (passed)
   Has studied spell Light to at least 10% (passed)
  Abilities:
   May train skill Cast generic to 26%
   May train skill Cast psionic to 26%
   May train skill Cast control to 26%
   May train skill Mana control to 38%
   May train skill Attack to 22%
   May train skill Consider to 38%
   May train skill Short blades to 22%
   May study spell Mind blast to 40%
   May study spell Mirror image to 40%
   May study spell Darkness to 40%
   May study spell Light to 40%


 Level 3:
  Requirements:
   Has trained skill Cast generic to at least 21% (passed)
   Has trained skill Cast psionic to at least 21% (at 0%)
   Has trained skill Mana control to at least 30% (passed)
   Has studied spell Mind blast to at least 30% (at 0%)
   Has studied spell Darkness to at least 20% (passed)
   Has studied spell Light to at least 20% (passed)
  Abilities:
   May train skill Cast generic to 35%
   May train skill Cast psionic to 35%
   May train skill Cast control to 35%
   May train skill Mana control to 57%
   May train skill Attack to 25%
   May train skill Consider to 57%
   May train skill Short blades to 25%
   May study spell Mind blast to 60%
   May study spell Mirror image to 60%
   May study spell Darkness to 60%
   May study spell Light to 60%


 Level 4:
  Requirements:
   Has trained skill Cast generic to at least 27% (passed)
   Has trained skill Cast psionic to at least 27% (at 0%)
   Has trained skill Mana control to at least 45% (passed)
   Has studied spell Mind blast to at least 45% (at 0%)
   Has studied spell Darkness to at least 30% (at 22%)
   Has studied spell Light to at least 30% (passed)
  Abilities:
   May train skill Cast generic to 44%
   May train skill Cast psionic to 44%
   May train skill Cast control to 44%
   May train skill Mana control to 76%
   May train skill Attack to 29%
